# Generated Flutter/Dart and IDE files
**/.dart_tool/
**/.flutter-plugins
**/.flutter-plugins-dependencies
**/.idea/
**/*.iml
**/build/
**/coverage/
**/ephemeral/
**/Pods/

# Local machine configuration and credentials
**/local.properties
**/key.properties
**/*.keystore
**/*.jks
**/*.p12

# Generated Windows installers and staging payloads
**/dist/
**/*-staging/
**/*.exe
**/*.msi
**/*.apk

# Generated macOS signing runtime (created by scripts/make-macos-jre.sh)
**/assets/signer-macos/

# Logs and temporary files
*.log
*.tmp
*.swp
.DS_Store
